  "content": "\n\n<center>\n\n![自然紋理包標頭](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/fb44581e3205bd40b398deb02d9385dc4f775854.png)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">自然紋理包</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/natural-texture-pack\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/natural\">\n  <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"ghsponsors-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\n讓你的世界呈現更自然的風貌。這是一款以柔和色調與線條為基礎的紋理包。\n<p></p>\n\n此紋理包提供了方塊、物品、實體及介面的細緻紋理，在維持原版遊戲氛圍的同時，增添更精緻的質感。\n<p></p>\n\n<details open>\n<summary>預覽</summary>\n\n![世界預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/7485212caea176aedfec6dedeefdd8c379af8a5e.jpeg)\n\n![櫻花林地](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/8385b990fc6950736db75dd81bafe71a1b4d2164.png)\n\n![平原村莊](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/b6e9a1e2c16c84ba0f947ca28611c4843feddcf3.png)\n\n![沙漠中坐在灰貓旁的駱駝](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/5952ce907b652378717f5052b26468323544dbb6.png)\n\n![珊瑚礁](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/11769a64aca6bfac